# Import into the shipshit-caddy Caddyfile. api.dailydraft.fun resolves to
# 52.8.153.188 (Route53 zone Z09742203V5F08IZVJZCS). Caddy provisions the
# certificate on first request, so the name must already resolve before this
# fragment is loaded -- a non-resolving host burns Let's Encrypt failure budget
# for every other tenant this instance terminates TLS for.
#
# The upstream is the container name the deploy script renames into place, on
# the Docker network shipshit-caddy shares with it.
api.dailydraft.fun {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy api-dailydraft-fun:3000
}
